    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cRock\u2019n Slayer&quot; is a VR rhythm action game in which you become a rock star and defeat demons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Feature 1. Exhilarating rhythm battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle link to the rock music\u2019s rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay Guitar and drum shaped demons by picks and drumstick-type weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Feature 2. Experience to be a rock star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a rock star and reclaim your stolen heart and music power from the daemons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through fighting, the rock star remember the music he really wanted to play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cRock\u2019n Slayer&quot; is a VR rhythm action game in which you become a rock star and defeat demons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Feature 1. Exhilarating rhythm battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle link to the rock music\u2019s rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay Guitar and drum shaped demons by picks and drumstick-type weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Feature 2. Experience to be a rock star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a rock star and reclaim your stolen heart and music power from the daemons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through fighting, the rock star remember the music he really wanted to play.</p>",
